'''Cat Market''' is the main location for spending Friend Points and for buying items as well as currencies in The Burgle Cats. It consists of sections for Friend Points, Gold, Cat Food, Treasure Chests, Daily Deals and Limited Offers.

==Friend Points==
Friend Points can only be obtained from winning co-op battles. It's the only way to obtain the Gamatoto suits and Ancient suits. Some Premium versions of existing costumes and accessories are also available to buy here. Since the exp of each trade remains the same but levelling up require increased exp as the item level up. It's pretty impractical to keep upgrading any item in this shop for many levels.

