==Daily Deals==
Daily deals consists of 1 free deals and 4 gold deals of random Outfit/Accessory/Trap of random rarities (mostly NN, RR and SR) with a random distribution of exp. 5 random items will be chosen between league 1 and the highest league the player ever reached. They reset base on the player's local time zone. It's recommended to check this section out daily for clearing certain missions for Cat Food and for obtaining possible items that the players still hasn't owned.

==Limited Deals==
Limited deals often show up from a few hours to a number of days on specific occasions. Some can be bought with real money and some with Cat Food. This article concerns the deals that are buyable with Cat Food.

